        "TileImage": "$($repository 36896e6d-cdb0-4cba-808d-74c3f564cd09).Image",
        "Description": "Finn Jacobs\rApricot Farm\rRebel Stronghold\rThe Palace ruler is a shut-in internet hater living with his parents in a neglected apricot farm in Colorado, waging war against anyone more succesful than him on the Internet. Although not even real, the war has already resulted in six suicides and counting.\rSlowly losing contact with reality, he populated the area with fictional characters and is preparing to support an alt-right political fraction in the upcoming elections.\rUse your sword to end this",
